SY_TALK("R8M2Gk5RSbo",[[9,["Shri Mataji: Good evening."]],[11,["Audience: Good evening."]],[17,["Shri Mataji: Today is the last day, when I","have to go."]],[27,["And you can understand a mother who has so","many children, she has to go from one to another;"]],[38,["she has the expectation to meet her children","and she has the concern and the longing for"]],[54,["whom she has so much love."]],[61,["That's very difficult to express those feelings:","like waves as if they are taking out something"]],[71,["from you."]],[78,["I do not know really how to thank you all."]],[83,["Without you I cannot enjoy anything."]],[86,["As I told you, even I may be the Capitalist","and I may have all these powers, so-called,"]],[94,["I'm a complete Communist, I can't enjoy it","alone."]],[100,["I have to share it with you."]],[104,["At the very outset, I would like to thank","Mr. Sig Paulsen for making it available for"]],[114,["Me, this beautiful church."]],[118,["And you all that I could manifest My love,","could have a rapport with you, whom I have"]],[133,["known before."]],[134,["I'm meeting you again, thanks to him."]],[139,["I have to thank Betty, specially."]],[144,["She has been so earnest."]],[146,["She wrote to Me letters, she telephoned to","Me again and again."]],[151,["Oh, she took so much trouble to see that I","come to Houston."]],[161,["She has made these four days, fantastic visit","for Me."]],[168,["You all have to thank her for what she's done,","it's a very, very great thing that she thought"]],[176,["of you all and of sharing her joy with you","all."]],[182,["She got her realization in Australia."]],[186,["It's a chain of thanking, for which I have","to thank Doctor Warren who came to India for"]],[194,["his realization, and I got stuck to him..."]],[202,["He was running every moment and he got his","realization."]],[208,["Then we have other people here from India."]],[212,["Nirmala Modi has come all the way, she's a","very wise Sahaj yogini."]],[221,["And then we have Hugo, you know he came all","the way."]],[228,["Went to Japan from Australia, bought these","equipments and he's come to New York, then"]],[235,["to Houston."]],[238,["Think of them, how much they feel responsible","that they should communicate truth to you"]],[247,["and that they should arrange this beautiful","program."]],[253,["Warren's wife has also come here."]],[256,["We have also, another American, Michael, who","is helping a lot."]],[264,["The best of all, I would say is one of my","eldest sons, is Mr Gavin Brown."]],[272,["Who had something to do with Houston."]],[275,["And when I wanted him to put some money for","American tour, I don't know why, he put it"]],[284,["in Houston Bank."]],[286,["I said, \"Why Houston of all the things?"]],[289,["I may never go there.\""]],[290,["He says, \"No Mother, Houston is the place.\""]],[294,["Still the money is lying in the Bank here,","for next years program perhaps."]],[300,["He has worked very hard and he's going to","stay on here."]],[305,["He's a quiet person."]],[308,["But he knows a lot about Sahaj Yoga."]],[311,["He knows it thoroughly."]],[313,["He'll tell you each and every thing: How to","cure you chakras."]],[317,["How to feel all right."]],[321,["Now today, on this day, I'm going to tell","you about the Spirit."]],[329,["I have told you about the seven chakras, about","the three nadis, the three channels, that"]],[337,["are within us."]],[339,["And today I want to tell you about the nature","of the Spirit."]],[349,["The Spirit resides us in our heart."]],[356,["It's the reflection of God Almighty."]],[361,["In Sanskrit language: this aspect of God which","is all-pervading and is the first and the"]],[370,["last, is called as Sadashiva, is the Father,","who does not incarnate."]],[381,["We say Yahova, you can say, or the God who","does not incarnate."]],[389,["This great aspect which encompasses everything","ultimately and also manifests everything,"]],[402,["is reflected within our heart as the Spirit."]],[408,["This aspect is just the witness aspect."]],[413,["It witnesses the play of its power, the Primordial","Power, the Holy Ghost, to see what is created"]],[426,["by Her."]],[428,["He's the only enjoyer of the game."]],[430,["He sees the game, the leela, the fun."]],[434,["She organizes everything, it is She who gets","divided into three powers, it is She who creates"]],[440,["the whole universe, it is She who gives us","this evolution, it is She who makes us human"]],[448,["beings and it is She who has to make us the","higher human being."]],[454,["That's the Holy Ghost, the Primordial Holy","Ghost and the reflection of that is this Kundalini"]],[460,["within us."]],[464,["These two have to meet."]],[466,["They are separated; the Spirit within you","and the Holy Ghost within you have to meet."]],[473,["That is the Yoga, that's the union."]],[478,["The seat of the Spirit is on top of your head","here, but He resides in human beings in the"]],[484,["heart; of course it comes out also and watches","you."]],[490,["It is not in our conscious mind, it resides","and watches the whole field."]],[496,["[DEL: In San- ] In Gita He's called as Kshetragya,","the one who knows the field, the knower of"]],[502,["the field."]],[503,["He knows everything, He watches; He's just","watching, where we go, what we do, what compromises"]],[509,["we make, how we run after our seeking, how","we go to falsehood, what we do; everything"]],[517,["it is watching."]],[520,["The Holy Ghost is the one which receives the","information and records everything in itself"]],[526,["but the information is given by the deity","who is the seed or the spirit of Jesus Christ"]],[535,["who is sitting down there, Ganesha."]],[543,["The Spirit itself is Sat-Chitt-Ananda."]],[551,["He exists in the state of truth."]],[560,["Now we do not know what truth is."]],[564,["People say, \"God is Love, God is Truth.\""]],[568,["Now what is the truth?"]],[574,["The truth is this all-pervading power."]],[580,["And this all-pervading power is the nature","of the Spirit, which gives you the absolute"]],[596,["knowledge; now mark it; absolute knowledge."]],[601,["For example, if you have to say, \"What is","the shape of this ...?\""]],[609,["You will say, \"It's a pyramid.\""]],[613,["All right, but is it a good thing to have","a pyramid for a church or not?"]],[623,["There could be hundred opinions on that."]],[629,["But if you ask Me, or ask any Sahaj yogi,","they said, \"Yes, it has to be a pyramid.\""]],[636,["Why?"]],[638,["Because in a pyramid there is a coefficience","and you feel the vibrations."]],[643,["It's absolutely, absolute knowledge."]],[652,["That's the truth you know."]],[655,["You want to know if a person is fake or not."]],[661,["You just put your hands like this and ask","a question, \"Is he true?\""]],[671,["Your vibrations will stop, you may even get","blisters,"]],[675,[" if you ask such a question about someone."]],[680,["So you do not know through your mental activity."]],[684,["A person may look very nice, as I told you,","he may behave in such a manner, that you'll"]],[688,["feel, \"Oh, what a fine man he is.\""]],[690,["Is such and such person is a realized soul","or not?"]],[697,["How will you know?"]],[699,["You'll just put your hands towards that person","and you'll start getting the vibrations from"]],[704,["that person; you'll enjoy them."]],[706,["Only after realization only we can really","enjoy other person - really enjoy."]],[716,["One day I was in Calcutta and staying in a","hotel on My way to Singapore, and there was"]],[723,["a very great soul who came to see Me."]],[728,["And he just sneaked into the room."]],[730,["See, sometimes it happens that some of these","great souls who live in Himalayas and all"]],[736,["that, they come in."]],[739,["And he just saw Me and he fell at my feet."]],[743,["And there were at least five, six Sahaj yogis","staying in other rooms and suddenly they felt"]],[749,["tremendous cool, joy falling on them, a cold","shower like thing."]],[758,["And they all came running, one after another."]],[763,["\"What's happened, what happened?\""]],[766,["And he was at My feet."]],[767,["They opened the door and they said, \"Oh, Mother!\""]],[771,["\"Mother, how did you come?\""]],[773,["\"Oh, Mother!\""]],[775,["And then they started feeling him."]],[777,["He was enjoying Me, I was enjoying him."]],[780,["And they were all enjoying him."]],[784,["You don't have to tell whether a person is","true or not."]],[789,["There is no mental deduction, it just happens."]],[796,["You start feeling."]],[797,["Even children are like that, even small children."]],[801,["If they are realized souls, immediately they'll","say, \"This is this and this is this,\" finished."]],[806,["There's no compromise, how can you compromise?"]],[808,["That's what I told you yesterday that Christ","never compromised."]],[814,["He'd never compromised."]],[818,["How can you compromise with darkness if you","are light?"]],[824,["So the first thing you are, you are the truth."]],[828,["The Spirit tells you what is the truth."]],[835,["It tells you everything about everything."]],[844,["It is the truth; the knowledge that is pure","is the truth."]],[854,["As I told you, Gavin Brown, when he got his","realization, he said, \"My father has not telephoned\""]],[859,["and he put his hands there and he got a burning","here and when they telephoned, he found out"]],[864,["that his father was down with bronchitis,","and I told him the exactly the same thing."]],[871,["Now a person who came to Me the other day","who had multiple sclerosis - is a very serious"]],[879,["disease according to doctors, but according","to Me it is not."]],[885,["And everybody told Me the same centers he","was catching."]],[889,["Of course because I have been in the medicine,","I have been in the medical college, I know"]],[896,["these chakras means what."]],[899,["And he told Me that he had this problem."]],[901,["Even if he not told Me, I would have known","that he had this problem."]],[906,["Everybody will see the same centre is catching."]],[911,["So, you are the truth."]],[915,["Then after some time you cannot bear untruth."]],[921,["You cannot bear falsehood, I mean, we also","are like that, I tell you."]],[927,["For example, if I tell you that, \"You come","along here there's a very nice chair for you.\""]],[932,["Now you don't see any chair there."]],[935,["\"Oh you sit down, it is there, believe Me,","imagine there's a chair.\""]],[941,["I mean, nobody would accept that, will you?"]],[944,["You don't see any chair."]],[945,["\"There is any.-\""]],[946,["\"No, no, but the imaginary, there is one,","I have placed it, you can't see, I have made"]],[950,["it invisible."]],[951,["You see you just see, you sit down you'll","get it.\""]],[954,["All right you sit down there, and you sit","in that position and after some time you start"]],[959,["getting the pain."]],[960,["\"Where's the chair, how do I get the pain.\""]],[966,["That's what Warren told you, it's very practical."]],[974,["You immediately know that this is not the","way."]],[982,["Now the first centre is very important, is","of the innocence,"]],[991,[" which gives you the magnetic powers."]],[997,["In the sense not only that you are attractive","but, I mean you attract people, but magnetic"]],[1003,["means that you know whether you are moving","to the north or to the south."]],[1008,["Birds have this power in them, birds have."]],[1012,["That's how they fly from one place to another."]],[1017,["Because they can feel the magnet within."]],[1019,["And a person who is pure at that point, he","never gets lost because he knows which side"]],[1025,["he's moving."]],[1026,["I mean, I have that power, I have never had","a problem like that."]],[1030,["I move either to the left or to the right,","or to forward."]],[1035,["And My husband who is dealing with shipping,","he says, \"I have never met a better navigator"]],[1038,["than my wife.\""]],[1042,["And it's so spontaneous, I mean, I don't have","to think, I know for definite that you are"]],[1048,["moving in the wrong direction or in the right","direction."]],[1050,["Even the material movement I mean to say."]],[1054,["All of them have experience, they have great","drivers and they have got all the maps and"]],[1060,["everything."]],[1061,["And immediately I know that you are going","on the wrong direction because the magnet"]],[1067,["immediately turns round."]],[1071,["So the magnet is placed within you there,","but it is to be awakened."]],[1076,["When it is awakened, these deities when they're","awakened, you become the truth."]],[1083,["Like the light that comes in, you start seeing","everything as far as your feelings are concerned,"]],[1090,["your experiencing is concerned."]],[1093,["So you become the truth."]],[1098,["Now one may say, \"How truth could be love?\""]],[1101,["That's a very common question."]],[1102,["Truth cannot be love because, I mean, if you","tell somebody something that is truth, he"]],[1109,["may not like, and he may be unhappy and it","may not be dear to him, and he might be very,"]],[1115,["very worried about it."]],[1120,["Manu said, long time back that, \"You should","speak the truth and you must speak the things"]],[1129,["which are dear to others.\""]],[1132,["\"Satyam vadet, priyam vadet.\""]],[1134,["People said, \"It's not possible, it's an absurd","situation, how can you do it?\""]],[1139,["So Krishna has put something in between, he","said, \"Satyam vadet, hitam vadet, priyam vadet.\""]],[1145,["You say something that is the truth, always","say the truth, and say something hitam, means"]],[1155,["for the pleasing of your Spirit."]],[1160,["That's the condition."]],[1163,["And ultimately that becomes a very dear thing."]],[1170,["In the beginning one may not like it, but","ultimately, this will be very much liked,"]],[1178,["this truth."]],[1179,["So all these three he has put together and","said that, \"You have to speak the truth, the"]],[1185,["truth has to be pleasing to the Spirit, and","ultimately, the person is going to enjoy it.\""]],[1198,["So the truth is: everything is illusion, except","for the Divine Love of God that is all-pervading"]],[1212,["which you can feel through your Spirit."]],[1220,["This power has got telecommunication, it has","got all that you have created in the science,"]],[1231,["it can coordinate and cooperates."]],[1234,["It has got all the angels and all the great","souls to help it and to look after you."]],[1242,["And the top, topping the whole thing is the","quality that loves, it loves you."]],[1254,["So it doesn't come to you like a sword, it","gives you the time to improve, to judge yourself,"]],[1266,["to rise, to grow, just as a mother would look","after her child, forgive mistakes, see that"]],[1277,["the child rises and grows into complete manhood."]],[1286,["So it is love and the love that is so powerful","is the truth; and it never fails,"]],[1298,["it never fails."]],[1301,["For example you might think now, a man like","Sadat has died."]],[1304,["[Ed: Anwar el Sadat was assassinated on 6","Oct 1981, the day before this talk.]"]],[1306,["\"Mother how do you explain?\""]],[1307,["I mean, you never die, that's one thing you","do not know."]],[1311,["He can be born again, he would be born in","such a condition where he'll be"]],[1316,["much more effective."]],[1322,["He has himself died at the top of his glory."]],[1327,["I mean for him, he's a martyr."]],[1331,["If you see from his angle, everywhere in the","whole world, \"Sadat.\""]],[1337,["Sa-dat, it's a big name too."]],[1342,["But supposing he had fallen in his glory and","all that, then he would have died, then God"]],[1348,["would not have been just to him, I would say."]],[1353,["But he died in all his glory and he can be","born again."]],[1358,["And he can take a position from where he can","do much better work, in the name of God, in"]],[1370,["the field of God because now we don't have","to do any more work,"]],[1376,[" otherwise in any other field."]],[1377,["We have had enough of trains, we don't want","any more now."]],[1382,["We have had enough of plastics, now we have","mountains."]],[1387,["We have got too much of butter around, too","much of food, everything bit too much, I mean"]],[1394,["the house becomes a junk."]],[1398,["In any field we have overdone things."]],[1401,["We have exhausted this Mother Earth."]],[1404,["Now what do we have to do?"]],[1407,["Only in one field and the field that is of","God's work you have to do it."]],[1413,["But first you have to get connected and then","do the God's work."]],[1418,["And that connection is only through your spirit,","when you become absolute and you have the"]],[1425,["truth within you as a built-in awareness."]],[1431,["Is the awareness that becomes the truth."]],[1436,["So the first quality of the spirit is that","you become the truth, that you know the truth,"]],[1447,["that you take a stand on the truth."]],[1452,["Look at Christ."]],[1454,["He had nothing to do with women like Mary","Magdalene, I mean, nothing to do, I mean,"]],[1459,["He was virtue."]],[1466,["He was innocence."]],[1468,["But when He saw people were stoning her, He","took up a stand."]],[1472,["He took up a stand."]],[1474,["You have to take up a stand, stand on the","truth."]],[1479,["And he said, \"Those who have not committed","any sin can throw,"]],[1482,["and you can throw the stone at Me\"."]],[1484,["And nobody did."]],[1489,["He did this because He was standing on the","truth."]],[1493,["He took a whip and whipped those people who","were selling in the temple of God."]],[1501,["At the age when he was a little boy, he went","and argued with learned people."]],[1510,["Such people have no fear of anything."]],[1513,["What is there to fear?"]],[1515,["When you are standing on the truth, what is","there to fear?"]],[1518,["Truth is such a light that it gives you complete","picture of the whole thing."]],[1528,["There's nothing to fear."]],[1531,["Your Father, He is compassion, He's ocean","of compassion."]],[1540,["And He's ocean of love and ocean of forgiveness."]],[1545,["And He is now within you."]],[1551,["Who is more powerful than Him?"]],[1555,["It's very easy for many human beings to say,","\"Oh, we don't believe in God.\""]],[1558,["You believe it or not, He's there."]],[1562,["Those who say, \"We don't believe,\" it is better","that they should come and get their realization"]],[1569,["and understand that there is very little time","left for such kind of nonsensical statements."]],[1577,["I mean you can at the most say that, \"I've","not felt God so far and I'm open, if I feel.\""]],[1584,["But on what basis do you deny?"]],[1590,["What basis have you got to say that, \"We don't","believe in God\"?"]],[1596,["Not only, after realization you can prove","God, but you can show His miracles."]],[1605,["The second thing, the nature of Spirit is","that He's chitta, He's the attention."]],[1611,["He's the attention means when you become spiritually","enlightened your attention becomes enlightened."]],[1620,["Now enlightenment, what we understand of these","lights is that the lights are falling here,"]],[1627,["and we can see things, that's all."]],[1630,["But this attention which is being enlightened,","acts, it works, it has got loops, it has got"]],[1640,["weapons, it works."]],[1647,["You have to see for yourself how your attention","works."]],[1655,["Today there was somebody who went and told","one of the Sahaj yginis that \"I was sitting"]],[1664,["there and I was getting all negative thoughts","and was feeling horrible in my hands and I"]],[1669,["don't know why it was happening in the program.\""]],[1673,["So she said, \"Here you have come to pay attention","to Mother and to Her work and pay attention"]],[1682,["to your Spirit."]],[1683,["But if you are paying attention to all the","rest of the people here,"]],[1687,["then you are going to catch them.\""]],[1690,["Is a very simple thing, \"Where is your attention?\""]],[1695,["Ask this question."]],[1696,["This is a very common question in an Indian","home, a mother will ask the child,"]],[1700,["\"Where is your attention?\""]],[1703,["The basis of Indian life is chitta nirodh,","is to fix your attention in a proper way."]],[1712,["Where is your attention?"]],[1717,["Is it on your Spirit?"]],[1719,["Or is it on somebody else, like, \"My brother","is sitting here, my mother is sitting there,"]],[1726,["oh, that woman is very bad, she's jealous","of me,\" all this nonsense."]],[1731,["Where is your attention?"]],[1735,["When you get realized then you start seeing","through the window of the Spirit,"]],[1742,["your position changes."]],[1744,["As you're looking at Me now, then you come","back here and start looking at you this way."]],[1754,["Till you are realized you are sitting before","Me, but once you are realized you come here"]],[1765,["and see others from there, that's your fort."]],[1770,["Nobody can touch you there."]],[1773,["From there you see others, your attention","is detached."]],[1779,["So the attention becomes enlightened after","realization."]],[1786,["You pay attention to anything, it works."]],[1788,["It does work, no doubt, you try."]],[1792,["Those who have got realization should try","this."]],[1797,["Try your attention, but attention has to be","pure."]],[1803,["You have to purify your attention, and the","best way to purify it"]],[1809,["is to keep your Agnya Chakra open."]],[1812,["When this centre is open which is the centre","of Christ, which I have shown that it can"]],[1817,["only open through the Lord's Prayer after","realization."]],[1825,["When you open that, then you are in that state","where your attention is divine."]],[1836,["And you'll be amazed how things work out,","even the smallest things, the material things,"]],[1844,["the useless things and the great things, and","the subtle and subtlest,"]],[1850,["and how you start growing."]],[1854,["So the growth is to be achieved by purifying","your attention, and to purify this attention"]],[1862,["is to keep your Agnya Chakra open and be in","thoughtless awareness."]],[1870,["You watch something, you don't think about","it."]],[1873,["Zen said the same thing but I think people","didn't understand, you see, before realization"]],[1878,["it's like telling about colors to a blind","man."]],[1881,["Zen said the same thing, you watch a thing","without thinking about it."]],[1887,["They created patterns which didn't mean anything,","which you see it without thinking."]],[1893,["But that's only possible after realization."]],[1897,["So the thinking process minimizes and you","start witnessing."]],[1904,["The higher state than that of attention is","that you jump into nirvikalpa samadhi, into"]],[1913,["the state of doubtless awareness."]],[1917,["Now it is not doubtlessness because you've","argued it out or anything."]],[1922,["But is a state where you're doubtless about","things."]],[1927,["I mean the way you speak, the way you behave,","the way your attention is, you can make it"]],[1932,["out that \"I'm doubtlessly there.\""]],[1938,["The discrimination becomes so sharp that you","can just say, \"This is so and so and so,\""]],[1945,["there's no fanaticism about it."]],[1947,["As I told you this morning that if a blind","man cross over something and says, \"Oh there's"]],[1956,["a snake here,\" and he believes it's a snake,","he believes that it's a snake, that's fanaticism."]],[1962,["Because he has no eyes to see and he believes","it's a snake, he says,"]],[1965,[" \"Oh, there is a snake here, I believe!\""]],[1969,["But a person who has eyes sees, \"No it's a","rope, it's just a rope.\""]],[1974,["And he says, \"No, it's not, it's a rope.\""]],[1977,["But he has eyes and when he says with his","eyes, which can see that, that it's a rope,"]],[1983,["he means it, the truth - then he's not a fanatic."]],[1989,["But he's standing on the truth."]],[1991,["This subtle difference people don't understand."]],[1995,["Fanaticism comes through blindness and the","truth comes through realization."]],[2008,["And at any cost you'll not give up the truth,","any cost."]],[2014,["Now when I started My work in 1970, somehow","I knew all about these fake gurus and fake"]],[2022,["people, I knew about it."]],[2025,["And in My first lecture, we had about, must","be having about two, three thousand people,"]],[2033,["it was a very huge hall and I told the names","of all these fake people and who they were"]],[2041,["in previous lives and what they did, by names."]],[2046,["And everybody was amazed at Me, they were","frightened."]],[2052,["There was a Maharajah who was a friend of","My husband and all that, and he came and told"]],[2056,["Me that, \"Oh, I'm so..."]],[2058,["I'm very frightened for you.\""]],[2061,["I said, \"Why?\""]],[2062,["He said, \"These people are horrid."]],[2065,["They mean money, they mean their whole earnings","out of it."]],[2073,["How did you say these things openly and you","took their names?"]],[2077,["They will shoot you.\""]],[2078,["I said, \"Let them shoot."]],[2079,["I'll see who shoots Me.\""]],[2086,["They said, \"You see they will prosecute you.\""]],[2089,["I said, \"Let them prosecute.\""]],[2091,["So many years have passed, nobody has dared","to say that I'm telling the lies."]],[2103,["There is no fear."]],[2106,["You love, but you don't love satanic people,","you don't love Satan."]],[2113,["The Satan who has spoiled the Kundalini of","people, who has spoiled all the chances of"]],[2120,["their getting realization, as a mother do","you think I should say,"]],[2123,["\"They are very good people\"?"]],[2125,["I'm not a political figure and I'm not seeking","elections."]],[2132,["Cannot be a compromise!"]],[2136,["That's what happens to you also."]],[2139,["But by your own self-esteem, by your own glory,","people see, \"Here is the leader.\""]],[2154,["And you become the leader of the people."]],[2158,["You can, there is nothing to be frightened","of."]],[2166,["There should be no half-way, as Christ, as","he read it out to you, that lukewarm people"]],[2174,["he spits them out of the mouth."]],[2177,["If you are hot, if you are devils, we'll fight","you; if you are cold, you're my children."]],[2185,["But lukewarm people are static, because all","kinds of forces are pulling, there's no progress"]],[2193,["of any kind."]],[2194,["You come, you come, negative, positive, they","are pulled this way, that way."]],[2203,["There cannot be compromise with truth."]],[2208,["And then you will see you will have the real","collective force,"]],[2214,["the real blessings of God, in every way."]],[2221,["You don't have to worry about money, you don't","have to worry about anything, it all works"]],[2226,["out, everything works out."]],[2228,["You can't believe it how much it works out."]],[2234,["I will tell you about these Australians: Australians","were finding it very difficult to get a place"]],[2241,["to have an ashram, and one day, frantically","one of the girls telephoned to Me, \"Mother,"]],[2250,["we cannot have a place now, we don't know","where to go, we have sold our houses, we've"]],[2254,["no place to go to.\""]],[2256,["I said, \"Don't you worry, tomorrow, you'll","get it.\""]],[2258,["And she was surprised how I told her, \"Tomorrow","you'll get it.\""]],[2263,["After telephoning and all that, she went home","and she received a call..."]],[2269,["I mean there was a call from a... estate agent."]],[2278,["When they went to see him next day he said,","\"There's an ashram available,"]],[2282,["would you like to have it?\""]],[2283,["At a very cheap rate, they got a beautiful","house for the ashram."]],[2290,["In London, we had a some sort of a small ashram","and they were finding it very difficult for"]],[2295,["all these people to live there, because they","wanted to live together."]],[2299,["They said, \"Mother, we must have some more","rooms and some more place.\""]],[2304,["I said, \"All right you just pray, it will","work out.\""]],[2307,["You won't believe, we had started a co-op","in London, and they said it will take eight"]],[2312,["years to get a room out of this co-op."]],[2315,["That's London speed, just the opposite of","American."]],[2320,["And within a month's time, we got a huge house,","huge house with fifteen bedrooms and two big"]],[2328,["halls and we didn't know what to do with it,","and at such a cheap rate that for the whole"]],[2334,["week, only seventy pounds were to be paid."]],[2338,["But then the Sahaj yogis went and settled","down there because in London we have in thousands."]],[2344,["Then they said, \"Mother what about for others?\""]],[2347,["And within fifteen days we got a huge big","hotel with all carpets and with all curtains"]],[2358,["and everything provided for, cutlery, crockery,","anything you say was there."]],[2366,["Every thing - only for ninety pounds a week,","for at least twenty people to live very happily"]],[2377,["and big rooms each and big halls."]],[2382,["Just we got it."]],[2386,["You won't believe but it has happened just","before Warren's marriage and we didn't know"]],[2390,["where they are going to stay, all of these","who were coming to get married here, and they"]],[2395,["had a nice honeymoon in that hotel."]],[2399,["They didn't have to pay anything for it."]],[2402,["Yes, it works out."]],[2404,["Krishna has said, \"Yoga kshema vahamyaham.\""]],[2406,["You get to your yoga first, he never said,","\"Kshema yoga,\" he said, \"Yoga kshema vahamyaham.\""]],[2412,["You get your realization, you get your yoga","and then the kshema,"]],[2416,[" the well-being works out."]],[2420,["Everything is organized then for you, you","are on the stage, everyone works for you,"]],[2426,["believe Me, it happens that way."]],[2430,["What is there to hanker after, what is there","to ask for, I mean you ask for one thing,"]],[2435,["you get thousand, you don't know what to do","with them."]],[2440,["I don't know really- I don't know with Myself,","I don't know what to do , the way, I'm quite"]],[2445,["generous, I mean I try to give away so many","things but still My house, oh God!"]],[2453,["You can't imagine, you can't imagine."]],[2456,["In their wedding I gave fifty-one saris, fifty-one,","thinking that,"]],[2461,[" \"Now I'll some rest from these saris.\""]],[2463,["Again I went back, they are still there."]],[2466,["I don't know now what am I to do, I brought","now some to America to give away and all that,"]],[2471,["you just give and you get, everything, you","get fed-up!"]],[2481,["But only thing that I always, I have been","asking for are the seekers,"]],[2487,["where are they lost?"]],[2490,["Where are they?"]],[2493,["That's something still there, they are to","be saved."]],[2500,["Because as I told you Christ is going to come","back with eleven destructive powers and there's"]],[2507,["going to be no questioning, no realization,","just..."]],[2515,["All the negative forces will be killed and","those who enter into the kingdom of God will"]],[2521,["reside in the kingdom of God, will reside","there, the residents, the citizens."]],[2534,["As He said, \"If you want money, I'll give","you gold."]],[2541,["But I look after those who hanker after Spirit.\""]],[2548,["You enter through the door and He eats with","you, He shares with you."]],[2556,["For a realized soul the highest human beings","are the seekers."]],[2564,["You may be any king or anything, what does","it matter, there are so many roaming about."]],[2571,["But a seeker is the thing in the eyes of God","as the highest human being, who has to become"]],[2578,["a super-human being."]],[2582,["So your attention is filled, so many of these","miracles, you cannot imagine how many have"]],[2593,["taken place with Sahaj yogis."]],[2595,["One can write such a big book."]],[2600,["So the attention becomes pure."]],[2605,["You just can't see bad things happening, I","mean, you just don't like it, I mean, I feel"]],[2610,["like vomiting sometimes the way things are,","sometimes."]],[2614,["The things that you enjoy normally become","absolutely garbage, you just don't like it,"]],[2624,["the whole, the priorities change."]],[2629,["You become automatically virtuous, I don't","have to tell you, \"Be virtuous,\" you'll just"]],[2635,["become, and you start enjoying your virtues","and virtues of others."]],[2641,["You start enjoying other people because attention","becomes collectively conscious."]],[2650,["Our central nervous system is our attention","but this central nervous system becomes collectively"]],[2657,["conscious, becomes."]],[2664,["You are not bothered; somebody has cancer,","it's all right, \"I'll try to cure you.\""]],[2669,["You are not afraid you'll get cancer, nothing,","you are never afraid of it."]],[2675,["\"I'll try.\""]],[2677,["You put your hands like this, like that and","the fellow says, \"Oh I'm feeling very much"]],[2681,["better, I don't know, what have you done to","me?\" \"Nothing.\""]],[2685,["The attention becomes so effective, so powerful;","it does tremendous things and the attention"]],[2695,["among yourselves has a rapport."]],[2700,["They all move like the several drops in an","ocean, in a wave of love, it's so beautiful."]],[2711,["The white men came to India long time back","as this or that, but when they came with Me,"]],[2719,["you should see, we have some films how the","Indian villagers, you see, took them to their"]],[2727,["heart, danced with them, fed them, loved them,","it's so sweet."]],[2734,["And they write to them, it's so beautiful,","there's no artificial, it's not just a feeling,"]],[2741,["\"I love you, you love me,\" it's not there."]],[2745,["It's just the enjoyment of the company of","other realized souls."]],[2750,["We talk of big things, \"Oh, we are all brothers","and sisters,\" it's all talk, talk, talk, talk,"]],[2759,["Then you just become, you forget your color,","you forget your nationality, you forget everything,"]],[2766,["you just feel, \"Oh, thats a Sahaj yogi.\""]],[2771,["It's a very different plane into which you","arrive where you feel so happy, joyous, the"]],[2779,["whole thing is a fun."]],[2783,["And when it comes to helping, all of them","come together."]],[2786,["When they find a negative force is coming,","all of them come together."]],[2792,["There is never a discussion among them, never."]],[2796,["They try to pull him out."]],[2798,["They tell him, all of them will tell by their","own ways and method that, \"This is wrong,"]],[2801,["this is wrong.\""]],[2803,["It's such a combination, I never have to tell","them."]],[2806,["I don't have to tell them that, \"I'll give","you some lessons now,\" for example, \"How to"]],[2810,["carry on among yourselves,\" nothing, they","just manage."]],[2814,["Not only that but a person will say, \"Now","see,\" A will say to B, \"See I'm catching on"]],[2821,["my Agnya, will you please help me there.\""]],[2823,["That means, \"I'm ego.\""]],[2825,["And the other fellow he'll say, \"I'll..."]],[2827,["I'll try.\""]],[2829,["They just help each other, without feeling","bad, there is no remorse of anything, there's"]],[2835,["no heart burning, no jealousy."]],[2841,["What a relationship is established like one","finger doesn't have jealousy with the other."]],[2847,["You have no jealousies with the other cells","of the same primordial being."]],[2854,["There is no need even to talk of love, you","are in love."]],[2858,["Everybody can see that your love."]],[2861,["It's really worth seeing how we become so","much adaptable, so much silent and happy people,"]],[2874,["when our attention becomes collectively conscious,","because that's the real source of joy."]],[2884,["And the greatest quality of the Spirit is","that you're pure joy."]],[2891,["It's pure joy."]],[2893,["We talk of unhappiness and happiness, sorrow","and ecstasy and all these words."]],[2901,["But joy is pure, it hasn't got the duality,","it's one, single, absolute."]],[2911,["I'm leaving you and My heart is wrenching."]],[2919,["The joy is seeing that."]],[2925,["Seeing that this Nirmala is wrenching, bleeding."]],[2934,["The joy is seeing and when I go, this feeling,","I will think and I'll think of you and the"]],[2946,["joy will be again repeated."]],[2948,["That joy of oneness, even in separation the","oneness I feel it, the concern."]],[2957,["Which cannot be expressed in words, that silent","pulling of your heart - that is also joy."]],[2973,["Joy is absolute, it comes through seeing."]],[2980,["You see it and you get the joy."]],[2987,["Joy is the quality when you gradually move","from the brain, the attention first goes into"]],[2996,["the brain, specially in the West, is the brain","first, takes place, means you become the attention,"]],[3002,["I'm sorry, you become the truth."]],[3005,["Means you start feeling in the hands, you","understand, then you see, \"Yes, it is so and"]],[3010,["this person has got this trouble, so he must","be having arthritis if he's catching on this,"]],[3015,["yes true.\""]],[3016,["You start tallying, finding out and monitoring","it and again, again verifying it and you are"]],[3022,["satisfied with it."]],[3024,["So the attention first is nothing but starts","achieving the truth."]],[3036,["It's trying to feel the truth but it's dry,","at that stage, it'sdry - in the West, specially,"]],[3048,["because we are differently made in the West."]],[3053,["Then we read the book, \"Advent,\" we like it","and we see all these things and knowledge"]],[3058,["and everything you like, you want to listen","to the t- My speech and all that."]],[3063,["You all like it."]],[3066,["Is the knowledge because you see the truth,","the knowledge - that's the gift of the brain."]],[3075,["Is the central path as I can say \"the awareness.\""]],[3080,["Then you feel your chitta, your attention","which is enlightened,"]],[3086,["and you're blasted with it."]],[3088,["You see the miracles happening, \"That's happening...\"","you are just blasted."]],[3094,["Then the third thing happens; is the joy:","that you are in joy all the time."]],[3103,["You cannot keep serious for more than two","minutes; it's very difficult to keep serious."]],[3114,["The sense of humor is so beautiful, you never","use vulgarity or hurting things or personal"]],[3122,["remarks, but the whole thing is so beautiful."]],[3126,["When you speak, people feel the flowers throwing","their fragrance at you."]],[3137,["Every action that you do creates joy, ripple","of joy."]],[3143,["Every movement you do, every vision you see,","gives you joy."]],[3152,["That time you feel perfected."]],[3158,["When you see a picture which is beautiful,","immediately you go into thoughtless awareness,"]],[3166,["and the complete joy of that creation starts","dropping on you, you just feel the joy."]],[3173,["Then you become silent, you don't speak...","much, you don't think, you become the joy,"]],[3185,["ananda."]],[3190,["That's the perfect state in which you should","be."]],[3197,["It's so beautiful that you want to be there","all the time."]],[3204,["This joy is the movement of your ocean of","love."]],[3219,["Is the beautiful movement of the clouds that","you see."]],[3231,["It's fantastic, you just get drenched into","it and you do everything for love's sake and"]],[3240,["you don't think you're doing it for love's","sake, you do not feel that way,"]],[3245,["you just do it because it's so joy-giving, ","that it is the greatest thing."]],[3250,["You may have... anything in the world will","not be that much joy-giving as this joy of"]],[3257,["the Spirit which you become."]],[3260,["You never feel lonely, you are never bored."]],[3265,["Whether you are alone or with anyone, you","are in joy."]],[3272,["One should understand that if you get your","Self-realization or if somebody says that"]],[3278,["they are giving you to some positive lines,","you should know,"]],[3283,["\"Are you peaceful within you?"]],[3289,["Are you joy?\""]],[3291,["Forget about the collective consciousness,","is your health all right?"]],[3299,["That's the minimum of minimum."]],[3303,["The whole system changes."]],[3309,["I just say that all of you should achieve","that state of joy"]],[3315,["by the time I come here next year."]],[3320,["And I hope you grow into it, by taking up","a stand on the truth, grow into it."]],[3328,["You progress into it."]],[3333,["It's so wonderful and so beautiful and that's","what your Father wants you to have."]],[3341,["He's the most generous Father; He can't enjoy","His kingdom unless and until He has given"]],[3347,["it to you, that He has made you sit on His","throne."]],[3352,["That's the greatest joy that He wants to have","and that's what you should achieve, that's"]],[3360,["what you should have, that's your right to","have."]],[3368,["This is what is Self-realization - you become","just the master."]],[3377,["You don't have to consult anyone, you know","it."]],[3383,["You have to just consult your Spirit through","your vibratory awareness, and you know it."]],[3395,["These are the blessings of Self-realization","into which you have to grow and as you grow"]],[3403,["you start manifesting your powers: you can","raise the Kundalini, you can give realization"]],[3410,["at the very outset."]],[3413,["Imagine the Kundalini moves under your finger,"]],[3416,["nobody can believe it but it has happened now."]],[3420,["Even very, very great saints, you see, there","is a very great saint who is more than hundred"]],[3427,["and eight years of age, and he asked Me, \"Mother,","I have spent thousands of years to get these"]],[3435,["vibrations and these people have got it without","doing anything.\""]],[3440,["I said, \"What did you..."]],[3442,["why did you do it, who asked you to do it?"]],[3444,["You should have taken it easy, you would have","got it.\""]],[3449,["He's a very sweet fellow, but because he's","got it through his effort, see he has that"]],[3456,["feeling that, \"I've got it through my effort.\""]],[3458,["You'll never get it through effort, I tell","you."]],[3460,["When you are finished with your effort you","just get it..."]],[3464,["[murmurs of laughter from the Audience.]"]],[3466,["Shri Mataji: ...maybe in an abstract way,","or maybe-"]],[3469,["Yes!"]],[3470,["When Buddha was tired, finished, fagged-out,","then he got his realization."]],[3479,["When you stop your efforts then only you will","get your realization."]],[3483,["\"So why to boast of your efforts?\""]],[3486,["I told him."]],[3488,["He's a very powerful man because he's done","lots of things and he always goes on a big,"]],[3495,["very big tiger and because he's hurt himself,","he says that people have beaten him, so he's"]],[3502,["hurt himself so he always uses a tiger."]],[3510,["And he's a man with the idea that he has these","powers, that powers."]],[3514,["So when I went to see him, I knew that time","because he told people that, \"Mother has come,"]],[3519,["so you go and see Her...\" and all that and","I knew he was there so I went to see him."]],[3524,["When I went to see him, we had to climb about","three miles, one had to walk up, and I was"]],[3530,["walking up and when I reached there it was","raining and I got completely drenched."]],[3536,["And this fellow is supposed have powers over","the rain."]],[3541,["And he was so angry when I went there he was","sitting on a little seat of his"]],[3549,["made of some   stone."]],[3551,["He was doing like this, like this, very angry."]],[3554,["So I didn't say anything, I went inside his","cave and sat down there in that drenched condition."]],[3560,["So he came down and he said, \"Mother, did","you do this to kill my ego?\""]],[3568,["I said, \"What?"]],[3569,["I didn't do anything."]],[3571,["What did I do?\""]],[3573,["He said, \"This rain wouldn't listen to me.\""]],[3576,["I said, \"Now, don't be angry,\" I said, \"Sit","down."]],[3580,["Haven't you bought a sari for Me, and you","are a sanyasi, I won't take a sari from a"]],[3587,["sanyasi, [son?]."]],[3588,["You have got a sari for Me, isn't it?"]],[3590,["So I have to get drenched, otherwise I will","not take sari from you.\""]],[3594,["And the whole temper melted away, whole temper","melted away."]],[3600,["Then I said, \"It was necessary the water to","flow over My body so that all the plains around"]],[3607,["you becomes beautiful, is vibrated with water.\""]],[3613,["But he is a very great soul I must say, because","he doesn't talk to Me"]],[3618,[" like ordinary human beings talk."]],[3621,["His style is different because he recognizes,","he knows who I am."]],[3628,["Is a very different thing, and a day will","come when you will also rise, you will rise"]],[3635,["and grow and grow and there will see the glory","of this great new age, new generation... into"]],[3649,["the complete newness of the being."]],[3655,["Today I was going to tell you about certain","diseases that one has and how to control them"]],[3661,["and I would suggest that we have a book - are","you going to sell it to everyone?"]],[3669,["Yogi from the side: There's a few of them","Mother."]],[3672,["Shri Mataji: We don't have many."]],[3675,["So we would say those who have been coming","for all the four lectures should buy the book."]],[3681,["We are sorry we don't have many books but","we hope to send you these books later on and"]],[3689,["is a very good book in which you can see what","imbalances can work out, like how you get"]],[3695,["diabetes, how you get kidney trouble, blood","pressure and then how you have to balance"]],[3701,["your liver, and how to look after the security","and all these things"]],[3710,["are written in that book at length."]],[3713,["Quite a knowledgeable book I should say."]],[3716,["I took the writer..."]],[3722,["I should say I really tortured him."]],[3725,["And everyday I used to see him coming up pulling","his ears, you see, that, \"I don't know what"]],[3732,["mistakes I'm going to do.\""]],[3734,["And every time he would come, I would say,","\"Now, Gregoire you have to be sweet as well."]],[3741,["It's not that sweet, you are still a scholar,","you have to be a Sahaj yogi."]],[3746,["And a Sahaj yogi is different from a scholar","so you write this book in such a manner, in"]],[3752,["such a way that it is sweet, it's loving,","it's kind,\" and I've tried really to curb"]],[3761,["it down, curb it down."]],[3764,["But he had written two chapters of his scholarliness,","all the scholarliness that he had, and it"]],[3773,["was like a... really a big boulder before","you when you enter into that book."]],[3780,["So one day I told him."]],[3782,["\"These two chapters, let us put it at the","end of the book,\" and he really collapsed."]],[3788,["He said, \"Mother, how can You do that to me,","it's too much.\""]],[3793,["I said, \"But why, what's the problem?\""]],[3795,["He said, \"These two chapters are the ones","which introduce the book and"]],[3800,["how can we do it?"]],[3802,["I mean, it's in the beginning and how can","You put it at the end?\""]],[3805,["I said, \"Gregoire, while correcting the book,","I saw to it that these chapters have nothing"]],[3811,["to do with the beginning, so you put them","at the end.\""]],[3819,["And he, when he placed them there he said,","\"Oh the book has become wonderful.\""]],[3824,["And then he told Me, \"It's a very good play","of Mother in this, that the intellectuals"]],[3829,["are never satisfied with the reading once,","and they would like to go into the intellectual"]],[3836,["rumination."]],[3838,["Like the animals you see, like cows when they","eat, then they take it back and again eat"]],[3844,["it, like that, So is better to put these two","chapters for them.\""]],[3848,["I said, \"Now you are not angry with Me?\""]],[3851,["He said, \"No, this is a very good thing.\""]],[3853,["But these two chapters definitely prove that","he's a very learned man."]],[3858,["And I told him, \"Gregoire, when did you read","all these books that you have quoted?\""]],[3862,["He said, \"Mother, you'll be surprised, these","quotations just came to me..."]],[3866,["I never, I never read them.\""]],[3868,["I said, \"You never read them?\""]],[3870,["\"Yes, yes, I had read them before, sometimes","I must have read them, but at the right time,"]],[3875,["I got the right quotation.\""]],[3878,["He's now coming to Los Angeles, he is a diplomat","in the Swiss government and he's coming all"]],[3885,["the way from Rome to Los Angeles, and he's","a very dynamic person, I'm looking forward"]],[3895,["to My visit to Los Angeles."]],[3896,["If you have any friends there or anything","you can write to them, you can take the address"]],[3903,["from here so that they can come and see Me."]],[3906,["We have now booked all our days, I am sorry","and still we'll contact somebody from Unity"]],[3912,["Church, but all the days are booked."]],[3914,["It's all right, and the people can come in","any case wherever you have the programs."]],[3922,["Anything else you want you can write to Me."]],[3926,["I'm sorry I can't write to you because every","day I work, like this the way I've been working"]],[3934,["here: morning, the workshop, evening, the","lecture."]],[3940,["It has been on and on for years together now."]],[3944,["So, I do write sometimes, but I don't have","so much time, but somebody will answer you."]],[3950,["Any question, any problem, anything, please","write to Me."]],[3956,["I'll be very happy to receive letters from","you and there are so many people who are sorting"]],[3963,["them out and looking after it, so you will","have an answer no doubt."]],[3968,["Please get My address also from the ashram","address from these people."]],[3974,["Anything that you want you can ask for it."]],[3978,["Even sitting down here I know your attention,","it will work out."]],[3984,["Gradually you will change and your asking","will be different and different and different."]],[3991,["May God bless you to blossom into the beauties","of your Spirit, so that you glorify your Father"]],[4003,["and He feels glorified with His gracious love","towards you."]],[4011,["Thank you very much."]],[4017,["Today, if you want you can just put your hands,","if you had"]],[4021,[" put your hands you would have got the vibrations."]],[4024,["I am sure there are some new people today","and they should also feel their vibrations"]],[4034,["on top of their heads; they might be feeling","already the Cool Breeze, just take out your"]],[4038,["shoes and you'll feel it."]],[4042,["On top of your head."]],[4053,["The tapes are with the Unity Church here,","you can buy them."]],[4059,["We have also sending twenty one tapes."]],[4062,["[Warren next to Shri Mataji]: They're already","being copied."]],[4064,["[Shri Mataji]: They are being copied."]],[4066,["We have so many tapes in London and you can","buy from the gentleman, we don't have to bother"]],[4076,["about money part, I mean, we are not bothered."]],[4078,["Only thing, as he must, they must have told","you, a little problem with our trustees, that"]],[4085,["you have to just say that we have the copyright,","that's all."]],[4088,["We are not bothered as to what you charge","and what you do it."]],[4092,["So you can buy the tapes as you like and you","can listen to them"]],[4096,["and enjoy them."]],[4103,["How many have come for the first time today?"]],[4106,["[Warren whispers]: Quite a few."]],[4110,["[Shri Mataji]: Now just take out your shoes","please."]]]);
